WEBVTT

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:04.980
<b>A woman bearing
 a destiny</b>

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:06.900
Are you ready?

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:08.900
<b>A messenger
 of destruction</b>

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:09.780
Yes.

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:11.780
<b>The awakening
 of the strong</b>

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.110
All right, Shuuyu.

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:15.740
Synchronize yourself with 
Sonshin's spiritual energy,

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:17.660
and unleash it all at once!

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:18.740
Begin!

00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:01.580
W-Wow!

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:03.310
I did not expect such power.

00:02:03.730 --> 00:02:06.160
The spiritual energy is 
far greater than before.

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:10.770
Overcoming hardship has 
strengthened Sonshin's powers.

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:12.440
Wow...

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:14.840
I could even beat that Hakuanshi guy!

00:02:14.840 --> 00:02:15.780
Grandfather!

00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:19.500
Give me a new general quickly, 
so I can start training.

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:20.870
S-Sure...

00:02:20.870 --> 00:02:23.760
Someone stronger this time.

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:24.640
Otherwise...

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:27.840
Hey, if Shuusou heard you 
say that he'd be sad.

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:32.060
Why should I care about the feelings 
of a general I can't remember?

00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:34.090
B-Because...

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:36.120
Wait, Ryou'un!

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:37.200
Wait!

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:38.590
Stop, Sonshin.

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:42.090
Shuusou must have known this would happen.

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:43.800
But...

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:47.680
The only thing that disappears is your 
memories of the time spent with the general.

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:50.770
So don't blame her.

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:52.110
But...

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:54.520
It's all my fault.

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:57.120
This place was once very busy.

00:02:57.120 --> 00:03:00.240
It was a place for talented lords to train.

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:02.460
But in the fight for the palace,

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:03.740
some died,

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:05.660
some left,

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:08.250
and at last, I was alone.

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:12.700
That was when Ryou'un was brought here.

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:16.300
I quickly realized her talents,

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:18.680
and tried to raise her to be my heir.

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:23.750
She never complained as she 
endured the harsh training.

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:26.970
She sacrificed the life she 
could've lived as a normal girl.

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:31.100
It seems I asked her for too much.

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:34.040
I think Ryou'un is happy.

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:36.700
That she was chosen as your heir.

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:40.740
At first I wanted to stop being a lord, too.

00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:42.280
But now...

00:03:43.060 --> 00:03:44.540
Wh-What?

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:46.830
It's rude to look at someone and laugh.

00:03:47.110 --> 00:03:48.120
It's upsetting.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:49.870
I'm going back to my card.

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:52.270
Don't be so hard on me!

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:53.150
Shut up!

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:54.750
Send me back to my card!

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:58.860
Sonshin, will you come with me?

00:03:58.860 --> 00:04:00.010
Sure.

00:04:06.310 --> 00:04:08.020
My general...

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:10.920
Wow!

00:04:10.920 --> 00:04:12.640
What is this gate?

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:18.650
Do you know why Kentei is 
after the Southern Palace?

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:20.710
Y-Yes...

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:24.320
There's something he needs to
restore the Kan Dynasty here?

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:31.000
I guess you know that much.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:31.840
Yes.

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:33.960
And it's back here?

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:35.770
Very sharp of you.

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:37.620
What's inside?

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:41.960
A general who was once 
known as the God of War.

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:45.100
The God of War?

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:46.940
Indeed.

00:04:46.940 --> 00:04:49.890
The card of Kan'u.

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:52.000
Kan'u?

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:52.640
Yes.

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:57.400
There are nine cards in this 
world with great power.

00:04:57.710 --> 00:05:00.400
Then this card is one of them?

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:01.870
Indeed.

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:05.700
And there are nine places 
like the Southern Palace.

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:10.670
And each of the shrines 
within protects one card.

00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:13.410
Nine shrines and nine cards...

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:18.380
It's said that whoever has all 
nine cards will gain vast power.

00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:20.410
Since the fall of the Kan Dynasty,

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:22.700
many have sought this card.

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:25.220
And each time, a foolish war resulted.

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:28.720
Is that why they want the card?

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:33.460
Kan'u is always given to 
the master of the palace.

00:05:33.460 --> 00:05:34.220
But...

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:38.740
I don't know if my power 
is great enough to use it.

00:05:39.190 --> 00:05:41.410
Then someday Ryou'un will take it?

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:42.190
Yes.

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:45.600
Is the reason you haven't given it 
to her because her spiritual energy

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:47.610
isn't strong enough yet?

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:49.660
The opposite.

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:52.330
It's hard to control a great power.

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:54.170
And Ryou'un is still young.

00:05:54.170 --> 00:05:56.360
If her heart is ever not at peace,

00:05:56.360 --> 00:05:58.080
Kan'u's power will swallow her up,

00:05:58.080 --> 00:06:00.170
and go out of control.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:04.670
Right now, she's like a 
blade that's too sharp.

00:06:05.350 --> 00:06:09.940
But a truly good blade is kept in a sheath.

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:12.040
If something happens,

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:14.260
will you be that sheath?

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:17.260
I'll become Ryou'un's sheath?

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:21.110
Why...

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:24.320
Why can't I stop thinking 
about this old wound?

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:27.640
What's going on?

00:06:27.640 --> 00:06:29.510
Why am I crying?

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:32.320
I shouldn't be sad at all!

00:06:32.710 --> 00:06:33.770
Hakuanshi-sama,

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:36.940
this is where the spiritual 
aura was flooding up from.

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:38.160
I see.

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:40.960
Let us pay them a visit, then.

00:06:41.280 --> 00:06:43.510
Hakkejin: Kyou!

00:06:57.590 --> 00:07:00.770
I've finally found the Southern Palace!

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:03.150
What's going on?

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:04.090
It can't be...

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:06.260
The Hakkejin?

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:07.950
This is bad!

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:09.570
The seal was broken!

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:12.640
Sonshin, take care of Ryou'un.

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:14.850
I'll seal this gate.

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:16.080
Right!

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:18.450
It can't be.

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:19.500
They found us?

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:30.020
Find them all!

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:38.380
I can't wait to fight!

00:07:38.840 --> 00:07:40.570
I won't let you have the glory!

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:44.480
Let us go take Kan'u, then.

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:46.720
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:47.940
<i>How could they find us so fast?</i>

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:49.960
Ryou'un, let's go!

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:52.320
Where are you?

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.410
I need to meet up with my grandfather!

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:01.550
What's your hurry,

00:08:01.550 --> 00:08:03.580
girl from the Southern Palace?

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:09.710
There you are, dog of Kentei!

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:11.510
I won't let you pass easily!

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:16.680
You're wasting your time, old man.

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:23.980
Ryou'un, where did you go?

00:08:24.390 --> 00:08:26.600
We meet again, boy.

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:27.660
You!

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:28.940
Shuuyu!

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:31.650
I won't let you go!

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:34.830
I'll stop you!

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:40.080
I'll fight you!

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:46.940
Not bad for an old man.

00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:48.120
Hakuanshi-sama!

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:51.130
Stay put!

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:53.220
Let me go, coward!

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:54.170
Ryou'un!

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:57.300
You should pay more attention, fool.

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:58.470
Grandfather!

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:04.640
Grandfather!

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:05.690
Sousei,

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:09.400
if she does anything suspicious,
kill her without hesitation.

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:10.700
You heard him.

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:13.390
Feel free to try something.

00:09:13.390 --> 00:09:18.820
Isn't it romantic to have a general 
and his lord killed in the same night?

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:22.090
I wish you could've seen the 
rage and sorrow in his eyes

00:09:22.090 --> 00:09:23.580
when my arrows pierced his body.

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:25.360
Oh, right!

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:27.500
You don't remember him at all, do you?

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:28.910
Ryou'un!

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:31.430
Stay put!

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:34.340
No touching your card, either!

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:37.220
Hey! Don't try anything.

00:09:38.230 --> 00:09:39.770
Ryou'un, are you okay?

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:41.380
Forget me. My grandfather...

00:09:42.870 --> 00:09:44.980
Ryou'un, are you hurt?

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:47.000
No, don't move.

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:48.100
Old man!

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:52.350
You shouldn't be so rude to your elders, boy.

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:53.470
Don't move.

00:09:53.470 --> 00:09:54.740
There won't be a second warning.

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:56.780
Grandfather, listen to him!

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:02.060
At last, it's time.

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:05.450
Now, let's take a look.

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:08.680
T-Take this, Ryou'un.

00:10:08.680 --> 00:10:09.500
Grandfather...

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:11.080
You bastards!

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:16.260
No...

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:19.050
No!

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:20.300
Old man!

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:21.970
No!

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:24.420
Now, it is mine...

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:26.850
I-It can't be!

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:31.610
R-Ryou'un...

00:10:32.210 --> 00:10:36.280
I'm sorry I couldn't protect you.

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:40.570
That's what you get!

00:10:39.560 --> 00:10:40.570
No...

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:42.200
Grandfather...

00:10:47.070 --> 00:10:47.600
Ryou'un!

00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:50.140
Hey, I said stay put!

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:51.210
No!

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:54.420
What?

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:58.190
No, Ryou'un!

00:10:58.190 --> 00:10:59.760
Get a hold of yourself!

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:02.970
This can't be... Kan'u!

00:11:07.590 --> 00:11:08.850
This spiritual energy...

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:15.980
N-No...

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:18.030
She summoned Kan'u!

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:21.870
Kan'u...

00:11:21.870 --> 00:11:24.920
turn this place into Hell!

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:29.960
<b>Vow</b>

00:13:01.110 --> 00:13:03.140
A demon god descends.

00:13:03.140 --> 00:13:05.840
The heavens roll with thunder.

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:07.530
The god roars.

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:10.320
The land of the living becomes Hell.

00:13:10.320 --> 00:13:15.240
It rages, shouts,
and finally kills its master.

00:13:15.240 --> 00:13:16.950
Can anyone stop it?

00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:19.190
Next time: Raging God.
